VCS_Context:1:1: [edit-of-described-commit] `jj edit @` targets a described commit.
  Rationale: Editing a described commit rewrites reviewed history in place and tangles unrelated work into an existing change.
  Suggestion: Create a child change with `jj new @`, then move the intentional fixes with `jj squash`.

